<title>AUSTRIA: Austria December wholesale prices up 1.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austria December wholesale prices up 1.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRCIES    DEC	  NOV	  DEC 1995</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	 0.3	  0.1	     0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr rise		    1.3	  1.5	    -2.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    104.4	104.1	   103.1</p>
<p>The statistics office also provisionally reported that the wholesale price index for 1996 were unchanged from the previous year at 104.3.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12254</p>
</text>
